OL,3,GNEWSAThe Newcastle fan kitting out
OL,4,AZambian footballers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe singing starts before the football
OL,7,Fdoes.
OL,9,FDressed head-to-toe in black and white,
OL,10,F11 players move together in a rhythmic
OL,11,Fwarm-up across a dusty football pitch
OL,12,Fin rural Zambia.
OL,14,FAnd when the players of the Mfuwe Mags
OL,15,Fwalk out to play, there is little doubt
OL,16,Fwhich English football team has
OL,17,Finspired their name.
OL,19,FTheir Newcastle United shirts have been
OL,20,Fsupplied by a Magpies fan living
OL,21,Fthousands of miles away in north-east
OL,22,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
